  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "在窗口安排售卖游戏",
        "en": "An ice cream shop window"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A999-255/22821a4dd22a.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "遮篷和售卖窗口把帐篷做成一个小店铺。可以轮流扮演店员和顾客，安排点单、取餐等过家家情节；食品造型道具可按自己的游戏需要另行搭配。",
        "en": "The awning and service window form a small shop. Players can take turns as shopkeeper and customer, making up ordering and collection games. Food props can be chosen separately to suit the game."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "PVC管架的配置写清楚",
        "en": "PVC tubes and connectors"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A999-255/c227313cac20.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "资料列有36 cm管22根、55 cm管4根，配直接头5个、直角三通6个、直角接头2个、四通2个和T形接头4个。搭建前可先按长度与接头形状分组。",
        "en": "The frame lists 22 tubes at 36 cm and four at 55 cm, with five straight, six right-angle three-way, two elbow, two four-way and four T connectors. Sort them by length and shape before assembly."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "整体尺寸80 × 40 × 137 cm",
        "en": "80 × 40 × 137 cm overall"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A999-255/17fb307b9d7c.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "组装后的尺寸为80 × 40 × 137 cm，布置时要给售卖窗口前方留出互动空间。原表彩盒尺寸56 × 8 × 25 cm，具体结构可对照组件与细节图查看。",
        "en": "The assembled tent measures 80 × 40 × 137 cm. Leave space in front of the service window for the game. The source table lists a 56 × 8 × 25 cm color box; see the component images for construction details."
      }
    }
  ],
